      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/airport/" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition">切换专栏：机场推荐专栏 ➜</a>
        <a href="/clash/" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition">切换专栏：Clash 客户端指南 ➜</a>
